    "folder": "0623 SpaceX 上市成史上最大 IPO：“星辰大海”还是资本神话？",
    "titleZh": "SpaceX 上市成史上最大 IPO：“星辰大海”还是资本神话？",
    "title": "SpaceX Prospectus: Our Mission",
    "topicEn": "Technology",
    "topicZh": "科技",
    "byline": "SpaceX Prospectus · Published June 23, 2026",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Our mission is to build the systems and technologies necessary to make life multiplanetary, to understand the true nature of the universe, and to extend the light of consciousness to the stars. Overview",
      "Founded in 2002, SpaceX is the only company building the integrated hardware and software infrastructure of the future across space, connectivity, and AI .... Since 2023, we have launched more than 80% of mass to orbit for the world each year with an over 99% mission success rate with Falcon rockets. We also operate a high-speed, low-latency global broadband data and communications network powered by approximately 9,600 Starlink broadband and mobile satellites in Low-Earth Orbit, delivering connectivity to millions of consumer, enterprise, and government customers across 164 countries, territories, and other markets. Using our dedicated satellite-to-mobile constellation, we offer connectivity services, supplementing terrestrial networks and substantially reducing mobile \"dead zones\" across approximately 30 countries.",
      "AI. We were the first company to deploy a coherent gigawatt-scale AI training cluster. We own and operate what we believe to be the largest AI training data center clusters on Earth, consisting of hundreds of thousands GPUs—all in the same spirit that enabled us to launch Grok faster than any other leading foundational AI model—while maintaining full vertical integration from on-site power generation and water reclamation to GPU deployment...The addition of the Terafab initiative aims to further extend our control to the foundational processor layer. We believe that the key constraints in the continued growth of AI are physical—chip manufacturing, data center infrastructure, and power generation...Our integrated AI platforms across Grok and X have over 1.3 billion supported accounts active in the last twelve months, including approximately 550 million MAU...Over the long-term, however, we expect Earth's finite resources will not be able to sustain the immense computational demands of advanced AI models. Sustainably satisfying this compute demand will require space-based infrastructure that utilizes the ultimate fusion energy source: the Sun.",
      "We have created distinct new markets across the space, connectivity, and AI industries by building the integrated hardware and software infrastructure of the future and by combining our broad range of capabilities.",
      "We have an intense, mission-driven, engineering-first culture that seeks to achieve what many have deemed impossible. \"The Algorithm,\" as it is known internally, is a five-step iterative process that emphasizes making the requirements less dumb, deleting unnecessary processes or parts (embracing the principle that the best part is no part), only then optimizing the necessary processes or parts, accelerating cycle time, and automating only proven processes.",
      "Why This Matters Now",
      "We believe the next paradigm shift for humanity is the creation of a resilient, perpetually expanding spacefaring civilization that drives continuous innovation across new frontiers, ultimately propelling us to Kardashev Type II status—a civilization that harnesses the full energy output of our Sun. In the near term, we expect space-enabled technologies to enhance life on Earth through greater global connectivity and breakthroughs forged in the harsh environments of our solar system, leading to accelerating progress in energy and AI. As we build infrastructure in the Earth's orbit, and potentially on the Moon, Mars and beyond, we believe we are capable of unlocking an era of unprecedented economic expansion, while also contributing to the safeguards of humanity's future against existential risk."
    ],
    "paragraphTranslations": [
      "我们的使命是构建使人类成为跨星球文明所必需的系统与技术，探寻宇宙的真实本质，并将意识之光延伸至群星。\n\n概述",
      "SpaceX 成立于 2002 年，是唯一一家同时在太空、互联互通与人工智能三大领域构建未来整合硬件与软件基础设施的企业。自 2023 年起，我们每年以猎鹰火箭承担全球逾 80% 的入轨质量，任务成功率超过 99%。与此同时，我们还运营着一张高速低延迟的全球宽带数据与通信网络，由近地轨道上约 9,600 颗 Starlink 宽带及移动卫星提供支撑。该网络已覆盖 164 个国家、地区及其他市场的数百万消费者、企业和政府客户。依托我们专用的卫星直连手机星座，我们能够对地面网络形成有效补充，大幅消除约 30 个国家的移动通信“盲区”。",
      "人工智能。我们是全球首家部署集成式吉瓦级AI 训练集群的企业。我们拥有并运营着我们认为是当前地球上规模最大的AI 训练数据中心集群，配备数十万块 GPU。凭借同样的精神，我们得以比任何其他顶级基础模型更快地推出 Grok，同时从现场发电、水资源回收到 GPU 部署，实现全链路的垂直整合。Terafab 计划的推进，旨在将我们的掌控力进一步延伸至基础芯片层。在我们看来，制约 AI 持续发展的核心瓶颈是物理层面的—— 芯片制造、数据中心基础设施与能源供给。过去十二个月，我们旗下 Grok 与 X 的整合 AI 平台合计服务逾 13 亿活跃账户，月活跃用户（MAU）约 5.5 亿。然而，从长远来看，地球有限的资源终将难以为先进 AI 模型的巨量算力需求提供可持续支撑。要从根本上解决这一问题，必须借助天基基础设施，充分利用这一终极清洁能源—— 太阳。",
      "通过构建跨越太空、互联互通与 AI 行业的一体化硬件与软件基础设施，整合我们广泛的能力，我们开辟出了数个全新的细分市场。",
      "我们拥有一种强烈的、以使命为驱动、以工程师为本的企业文化，致力于实现许多人认为不可能实现的事情。“算法”—— 内部对这套方法论的称呼—— 是一套五步迭代流程：首先精简需求、剔除冗余，继而删除不必要的流程或零部件 ( 秉持“最好的零件就是没有零件”的原则)，在此基础上才对必要环节加以优化，随后压缩迭代周期，最后将经过验证的流程自动化。",
      "这为何在当下至关重要",
      "我们认为，人类的下一次范式转变，是创建一个富有韧性、持续向外扩张的星际文明，跨越新疆域推动持续创新，最终推动人类迈向卡尔达舍夫II 型文明—— 即能够驾驭太阳全部能量输出的文明。近期来看，我们预计太空赋能技术将通过提升全球互联互通能力，以及在太阳系极端环境中锻造科技突破，切实改善地球上的生活，并加速推动能源与 AI 领域的进步。随着我们在近地轨道乃至月球、火星及更遥远之地持续构建基础设施，我们相信人类有能力开启一个前所未有的经济扩张新纪元，同时也为守护人类未来免遭存亡威胁做出贡献。"
    ],
