    "folder": "0625 《校园之外》里的冰球 F4 做对了什么？",
    "titleZh": "《校园之外》里的冰球 F4 做对了什么？",
    "title": "The School Outside: What the Hockey F4 Got Right",
    "topicEn": "International Relations",
