    "folder": "0722  这届世界杯，到底办的怎么样？1",
    "titleZh": "这届世界杯，到底办的怎么样？1",
    "title": "The 2026 World Cup: Political Drama and an Eye-Opening Affirmation",
    "topicEn": "Technology",
