    "exerciseTranslationPrompt": "恐音症是一种神经生理障碍，大致有两个特征：一是对声音产生极其强烈的厌恶，二是患者很难让别人相信，这种厌恶真的有那么严重。",
    "answerVocabularyList": [
      "murky",
      "incessant"
    ],
    "answerChoice": "D",
    "answerTranslation": "Misophonia is a neurophysiological disorder broadly characterized by two things: a severe aversion to sound and a struggle to convince others of the severity of that aversion.",
